## 4) `docs/architecture.png`  
I can create a simple ASCII diagram here and give instructions to convert to PNG, or — if you want a quick PNG — I will generate an SVG text you can save as `docs/architecture.svg` and open in any browser then export as PNG.

**Quick SVG** — create file `docs/architecture.svg` and paste this content:

```svg
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1000" height="520">
  <rect x="10" y="10" width="980" height="500" fill="#0b1220"/>
